id=fluttertap
name=FlutterTap
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=Eduardo Lopes
description=Redirects the network traffic of selected Flutter apps to a configurable proxy and bypasses TLS certificate verification, for traffic analysis purposes. Compatible with Magisk, KernelSU and APatch (Zygisk). Configure via the FlutterTap manager app.
